<text>
<p>Fiscal Year Ended</p>
<p>						    June 30</p>
<p>					    1996			1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			$6,784,748		  6,112,241</p>
<p> Gross Profit Margin	   2,901,847		  2,594,165</p>
